  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **GREY KNIGHTS** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), as [your opponent's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, you can pick units of yours on the battlefield whose models all have this ability, other than units in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit. The most you can pick depends on [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size): 2 in Incursion, 3 in Strike Force or 4 in Onslaught. Then:\n\n- put those units into [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)\n- during [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), they can arrive with an [ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move), even if it is your first turn",
